# 统一换行符入库形态：索引与仓库内一律 LF，检出行为交由 core.autocrlf 决定
# 现状核实：`git ls-files --eol` 显示全仓索引已是 i/lf，故本规则不产生内容变更，
# 仅防止后续新增文件在 Windows 上以 CRLF 入库造成 diff 噪声。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：禁止换行转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.zst binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary

# 模型产物与权重
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.safetensors binary
*.h5 binary
*.pkl binary

# 校验和敏感文件：保持原样
*.sha256 -text

# 第三方目录不参与语言统计与 diff
reference/** linguist-vendored
frontend/node_modules/** -diff
